{"speciesId":34,"names":{"fr":"Nidoking","es":"Nidoking","en":"Nidoking","ja":"ニドキング"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"It uses its powerful tail in battle to smash, constrict, then break the prey's bones."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"It uses its powerful tail in battle to smash, constrict, then break the prey's bones."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Its steel-like hide adds to its powerful tackle. Its horns are so hard, they can pierce a diamond."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It swings its big tail around during battle. If its foe flinches, it will charge with its sturdy body."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its tail is thick and powerful. If it binds an enemy, it can snap the victim's spine quite easily."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It uses its thick arms, legs and tail to attack forcefully. Melee combat is its specialty."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"NIDOKING’s thick tail packs enormously destructive power. With one swing, it can topple a metal transmission tower. Once this POKéMON goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"NIDOKING’s thick tail packs enormously destructive power. With one swing, it can topple a metal transmission tower. Once this POKéMON goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A NIDOKING’s thick tail packs enormously destructive power capable of toppling a metal transmission tower. Once it goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is recognized by its rock-hard hide and its extended horn. Be careful with the horn as it contains venom."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It uses its powerful tail in battle to smash, constrict, then break the prey’s bones."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It swings its big tail around during battle. If its foe flinches, it will charge with its sturdy body."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its tail is thick and powerful. If it binds an enemy, it can render the victim helpless quite easily."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un coup de sa puissante queue peut briser un poteau téléphonique comme une allumette."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un coup de sa puissante queue peut briser un poteau téléphonique comme une allumette."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"On le reconnaît facilement grâce à sa peau dure comme de la pierre ainsi qu’à sa grosse corne pleine de poison."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es fácil reconocerlo por tener una dura piel y un gran cuerno lleno de peligrosísimo veneno."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It is recognized by its rock-hard hide and its extended horn. Be careful with the horn, as it contains venom."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"石のように 硬い 皮膚と 長く 伸びた ツノが 特徴。 ツノには 毒も あるので 注意。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Un coup de sa puissante queue peut briser un poteau téléphonique comme une allumette."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Un golpe de su poderosa cola puede partir un poste de teléfono como si fuese una cerilla."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"尻尾の 一撃は 電柱を まるで マッチ棒のように 真っ二つに へし折ってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"L’épaisse queue de Nidoking est d’une puissance incroyable. En un seul coup, il peut renverser une tour métallique. Lorsque ce Pokémon se déchaîne, plus rien ne peut l’arrêter."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La gruesa cola de Nidoking encierra una fuerza realmente destructora. Con una vez que la agite, es capaz de tumbar una torre metálica de transmisión. Una vez que este Pokémon se desboca, no hay quien lo pare."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nidoking’s thick tail packs enormously destructive power. With one swing, it can topple a metal transmission tower. Once this Pokémon goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"太い 尻尾の 一振りは 頑丈な 鉄塔も へし折る すさまじい 破壊力。 一度 暴れだすと 手が つけられない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"L’épaisse queue de Nidoking est d’une puissance incroyable. En un seul coup, il peut renverser une tour métallique. Lorsque ce Pokémon se déchaîne, plus rien ne peut l’arrêter."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La gruesa cola de Nidoking encierra una fuerza realmente destructora. Con una vez que la agite, es capaz de tumbar una torre metálica de transmisión. Una vez que este Pokémon se desboca, no hay quien lo pare."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Nidoking’s thick tail packs enormously destructive power. With one swing, it can topple a metal transmission tower. Once this Pokémon goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"太い 尻尾の 一振りは 頑丈な 鉄塔も へし折る すさまじい 破壊力。 一度 暴れだすと 手が つけられない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Ses charges sont dévastatrices grâce à sa peau d’acier. Sa corne perce même le diamant."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Su piel dura como el acero refuerza el impacto al cargar contra sus enemigos. Su cuerno puede atravesar hasta diamantes."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Its steel-like hide adds to its powerful tackle. Its horns are so hard, they can pierce a diamond."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"鋼のような 皮膚を 活かした たいあたりは 強力。 ツノは ダイヤモンドも 突き刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Ses charges sont dévastatrices grâce à sa peau d’acier. Sa corne perce même le diamant."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Su piel dura como el acero refuerza el impacto al cargar contra sus enemigos. Su cuerno puede atravesar hasta diamantes."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Its steel-like hide adds to its powerful tackle. Its horns are so hard, they can pierce a diamond."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"鋼のような 皮膚を 活かした たいあたりは 強力。 ツノは ダイヤモンドも 突き刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Lorsqu’il s’énerve, il devient incontrôlable, mais il retrouve son calme face à Nidoqueen, sa compagne de longue date."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Una vez que se desboca, no hay quien lo pare. Solo se calma ante Nidoqueen, su compañera de toda la vida."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When it goes on a rampage, it’s impossible to control. But in the presence of a Nidoqueen it’s lived with for a long time, Nidoking calms down."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"暴れると 手が つけられなくなるが 長年 連れ添った ニドクインの 前では 穏やかな 顔に なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Très fier de sa force, il se bat vigoureusement à l’aide de sa queue robuste et de sa corne capable de briser le diamant."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Presume de su hercúlea fuerza y combate vigorosamente con su robusta cola y su cuerno, con el que hasta puede pulverizar diamantes."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Nidoking prides itself on its strength. It’s forceful and spirited in battle, making use of its thick tail and diamond-crushing horn."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"力自慢の ポケモン。 太い 尻尾と ダイヤをも 砕く ツノを 駆使して 豪快に 戦う。"}],"varieties":[{"id":34,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[2,"level-up",12],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[